.\n\nI would like to request art of my VTuber OC.  He is a failed experiment that lives alone in an abandoned laboratory.  I have included two references, please use the image called \"neck tattoo and halo\" as a reference for the markings on his neck and how his halo should look.\n\nFor his clothing, I would like to request a \"jersey maid\" style outfit that fits with his look!  I really like what you did with the character on the left here: https://twitter.com/nnme__618/status/1656311511646887936/photo/1\n\nI will leave the pose up to you.  His expression can be angry/annoyed.  If it is alright, please draw him smoking a cigarette.\n\nPlease include the PSD file if possible!\nI would like to share the image on SNS sites.\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1z5YWkrZctuFn1AC_pzml5TuEKwRsyuMV?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nnme__618/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2115688, "client_id": 3033136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e586d6f5/uploads/origins/221b9cae-07b8-41e3-9b3e-5e8f77533331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=088374bbea5627f8b37d73a854f0ce04", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e586d6f5/uploads/origins/221b9cae-07b8-41e3-9b3e-5e8f77533331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=088374bbea5627f8b37d73a854f0ce04, https://si.imgix.net/e586d6f5/uploads/origins/221b9cae-07b8-41e3-9b3e-5e8f77533331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea15df6f7ea650781afaa396821fab0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e586d6f5/uploads/origins/221b9cae-07b8-41e3-9b3e-5e8f77533331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14a471c5dedd40b55f3ec2acd258ebf1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "h